Subject: [PATCH 03/35] IbashoAgent: uploads and wearables

- upload: texture/sound/animation files through the viewer's own
  NewFileAgentInventory upload (normal fee), without the file picker,
  the modal "Uploading..." box or the inventory floater. Textures are
  encoded here so the fee follows the final size. Capped by max_cost,
  the new IbashoMaxUploadCost setting (L$50) and the pay caps; quote
  replies the fee only.
- wearables: what's worn, with item/asset ids, texture slots and tint.
- createWearable: new wearable of any type, named, optionally worn.
- editWearable: set texture slots, tint, visual params or name of a worn
  wearable, then save as the appearance editor does (new asset, item
  update, COF link refresh) so the server rebakes.
- rebake: Advanced > Rebake Textures.
